    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40466" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπείθ-ομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be persuaded</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ τις
				ἐμοὶ ἐπιπείσεται . . </span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴκαδ᾽ ἴμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.154
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεπείθετο θυμὸς ἀγήνωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					2.103
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>trust</i>
			<i>to, put faith in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαρτυρίοισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1095
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1389i
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				i 32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. <i>comply
				with, obey</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
