					Il.
					1.218
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				369
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖ παραινεῖς, κἀπιπείσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					1472
				</span></i>
			.</div>
